# An allowlist: the build context is exactly what infra/Dockerfile COPYs.
#
# Render builds from a clean clone, but a local `docker build .` would otherwise
# send the whole working tree — test data, the Flutter app and multi-GB audit
# files that never reach the image. backend/tests/test_container_image.py checks
# that every COPY source is admitted here.
*
!backend/requirements.txt
!backend/app
!rag-corpus
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
